* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* Function  Scan JES3 Queue and Create Source and Orders
*
* SJU 02-10-22 p(246164) copied from RMSCJES3 to work with NPR 3.2
* NPR 3.2 provides 2 options for JES3
* SPOOL=JES3 (compatibility mode) works similarly to NPR 2.2 and will be
* withdrawn in a future version
* SPOOL=JESC (consistency mode) works similarly to JES2
* This program needs to be able to handle both modes.
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999)  ...
* mrs 94-02-06 s(999999) created
* mrs 94-03-03 s(999999) RMRECN-N Interface modified
* mrs 94-06-23 s(999999) dbid, fnr in load order
